# <%= current_page.data.title %>

Welcome to the Justice Data Platform user guide!
The Justice Data Platform is in development and will provide Ministry of Justice staff with a secure and scalable way of processing
and managing data. You can [find out more about the Justice Data Platform](https://data-platform.service.justice.gov.uk),
or [view our feature roadmap](https://data-platform.service.justice.gov.uk/roadmap).

You'll find information here explaining how to use, operate and interact with the Justice Data Platform and its tools.
This user guide does not provide general training on data analysis, programming languages, development tools or products unless that
knowledge is specific to using the platform.
